      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TONY KLUMP (1) eye-catching debut run after settling well back but winding up strongly into the frame when second (20.02) at this track over 340m. Draws the cherry. Improver who can get off the mark this time. SELSDON (6) flew the lids from the middle with a slick turn of foot before finishing second (19.58) and beaten a neck over 340m at this track. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Leading player again. ADHANA FIZZY (3) did a good job to finish second last time out over 340m at this track (19.85) in a Grade 6, the second top-three finish on the trot. Well placed here and should do much better. BEARVILLE FLYER (8) is worth a look over a shorter distance this time.",
